{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "0CHT", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-integral}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7d88971922c39e8f4855398cb59f828dd193c78275ab2c9d6d116b3b0d2b3f6a", "source_text": "Integral and finite morphisms", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d15c748af2dc4a20917caa30efd9e3206a30d72abb96ab8302ade46907ab1a11", "unit_id": "tag:0CHT:title"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0CHT", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:12d1c26203c238910888604df4a6c9237c11bbb16c4e79c66f9a96553dbf6a59", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIntegral and finite morphisms of algebraic stacks are defined as follows.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bd1510258882d4318a750539faafc525b5b56573601afee8fad7c01bd3737845", "unit_id": "tag:0CHT:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "0CHT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-properties-section-properties-morphisms}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{stacks-properties-section-properties-morphisms}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-integral}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:49d50074a4e930bed2abd837d73697e21b90df3f9cff9f9a023bd5a56b0a05c0", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0ae77f5d19d5038cc05cdb87e60ba49959cb03f2916c59c07670a1e57b6f96d4", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> We say <MATH_0002> is <TEXTITOPEN_0001>integral<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if <MATH_0003> is representable and integral\nin the sense of Properties of Stacks, Section\n<REF_0001>.\n<STRUCT_0003> We say <MATH_0004> is <TEXTITOPEN_0002>finite<TEXTITCLOSE_0002> if <MATH_0005> is representable and finite\nin the sense of Properties of Stacks, Section\n<REF_0002>.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:45d56cb11fa56e570c9ff26a4ca4fd0f7b5a1221ccdcc9a6d84b549941baa934", "unit_id": "tag:0CHU:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0CHT", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-properties-section-properties-morphisms}", "SPACE_0001": "\\ ", "SPACE_0002": "\\ ", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4ac618bd1362592e1a8175839516f01262029faecaa7d6898e4773c0c31e37a6", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nFor us it is a little bit more convenient to think of an\nintegral, resp.<SPACE_0001>finite morphism of algebraic stacks as a\nmorphism of algebraic stacks which is\nrepresentable by algebraic spaces and integral, resp.<SPACE_0002>finite\nin the sense of Properties of Stacks, Section\n<REF_0001>.\n(Recall that the default for ``representable'' in the Stacks project\nis representable by schemes.)\nSince this is clearly equivalent to the notion just defined we shall\nuse this characterization without further mention.\nWe prove a few simple lemmas about this notion.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:10a7ff3b747bb13098981cd2954b65fd496b7e36ab0ecad4929a458ba88fce4f", "unit_id": "tag:0CHT:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0CHT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{X}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-integral}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7a7cf25a2fc50f8d8ad17c552b076ee86b97b5f0d2d2b7155de6c7482cb00c00", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d15937fa962d01a2cc0a05b1c55239f271d7ca6cc0082c1f8c4015797e1204e6", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nLet <MATH_0002> be an integral (or finite)\nmorphism of algebraic stacks. Then\n<MATH_0003>\nis an integral (or finite) morphism of algebraic stacks.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:78ee5a19624b63cefc94f0f391d9c4eb774968ab2167d9d8498c6be8f9d893c0", "unit_id": "tag:0CHV:statement"}
